          "name": "pqs:context",
          "value": "The application's core cryptography: Ethereum 4-byte function-selector derivation, keccak_256(force_bytes(text_signature)).digest()[:4] (abi.py:22-24), reached from Signature.save() (models.py:73) and the Solidity/ABI import paths. abi.py:19's import-time assert pins the original-Keccak empty digest c5d246...a470, deliberately distinguishing Keccak-256 from FIPS-202 SHA3-256. Keccak-256 is protocol-fixed by the Ethereum ABI spec — observable here, replaceable only at the Ethereum protocol level."
